  "bodyHash": "9a6ecd03a5e20c32",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829272/description_8efc8180-50e3-4376-b506-1f4629922f24.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"270\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdcchill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829272/description_36e68a7a-8da7-49a4-82f4-02400e7e54d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"80\"></span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">感谢400万次下载！</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Create Teleporters 重制版</h1>\n<p><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>警告：使用新的重制版升级旧世界可能会导致自定义传送门出现问题。升级时，您的自定义传送门将被占位块替换。只需将其开采即可获得新的自定义传送门基座。</strong></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d797\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qJhNtVP.png\" width=\"388\" height=\"136\"></a></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">需要 Create 模组</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">对原版《Create Teleporters》模组的完全重构。重新设计以更好地契合 Create 模组的新美学风格，并简化了使用方法。此重制版修复了旧版漏洞并优化了机制。</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">更新内容<br></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不再需要接收器。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">移除重力稳定器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">宠物不再随你一起传送。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">修复洞穴生成问题。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不会覆盖口袋维度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自定义传送门现为多区块结构。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提供不同尺寸的实体传送门。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">不再依赖 GeckoLib</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">简化了外观与模型。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">量子外壳采用连接纹理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全新 GUI 界面，风格与 Create 模组保持一致。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">普通传送链接（非高级传送链接）现在具有固定范围，可在配置文件中调整。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">实体传送门</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d4e2f05-2d4c-46ac-89d0-d19a5f04ecd3.png\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">物品传送门</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_21cea649-2396-4ada-bdec-37df61f6fc9f.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"297\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自定义传送门</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">由自定义传送门基座和量子外壳框架组成。</span></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c56999ea-8ae6-40fd-9b37-1e4e6e0a15fa.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"310\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73d9c7b6-8844-4ee4-95d1-c9b8d908ba72.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"285\"></span></p>",
